This project integrates with Caelestia and uses the installed shell's QML
components and design tokens. Caelestia is developed by the caelestia-dots
contributors and distributed under GPL-3.0:
https://github.com/caelestia-dots/shell

The test fixture tests/fixtures/Content.qml comes from Caelestia's dashboard
and is included under its GPL-3.0 license. Retrieved from the upstream main
branch on 2026-11-07. No complete Caelestia installation is bundled here.

EasyEffects and LSP Plugins are separate projects installed through the
user's distribution package manager. Their trademarks and code belong to
their respective authors. They are not redistributed in this repository.

Preview screenshots show the add-on in a presentation frame. The MP4 and GIF
show the user-supplied desktop recording. Music rights remain with the
respective owners; the GPL license applies to the project code.
